<title>PHILIPPINES: Centennial drops 6.45 pct in late trade.</title>
<headline>Centennial drops 6.45 pct in late trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine property developer Centennial City Inc fell by 20 centavos, or 6.45 percent, to 2.90 pesos on Wednesday on news the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) was considering suspending trading in its shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock is down probably on news that the SEC may suspend trading of Centennial,&quot; said Jonas Ferrer, research head at Pryce Securities.</p>
